    "text": "def find_max(words):\n    \"\"\"Find the word with with maximum unique characters.\"\"\"\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nset(word)\n\n    max_chars = 0\n    for word in words:\n        if char in set(word):\n            max_chars = len(set(word)\n            max_word = word\n        elif len(word) == max_chars:\n            max_word = word\n\n\n    return\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
